  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SISD Swedish Investors for Sustainable Development - SISD - L&#xf6;ner</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">SISD svenska investerare f&#xf6;r h&#xe5;llbar utveckling</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">SISD &#xe4;r ett n&#xe4;tverk som samlar &#xf6;ver 20 av Sveriges st&#xf6;rsta investerare kring genomf&#xf6;randet av Agenda 2030. Sida samordnar n&#xe4;tverket och bland medlemmarna finns AP-fonder, f&#xf6;rs&#xe4;kringsbolag, investmentbolag, kapitalf&#xf6;rvaltare och pensionsfonder. SISD arbetar med erfarenhetsutbyte, l&#xe4;rande, kommunikation och att utforska m&#xf6;jligheter f&#xf6;r investeringar i linje med de globala m&#xe5;len. 
Eftersom teamet som arbetar med n&#xe4;tverken SISD och Swedish Leadership for Sustainable Development (SLSD) sl&#xe5;s ihop under &#xe5;r 2020 g&#xf6;rs en separat beredning f&#xf6;r &#xe5;ren 2021-2022 som inkluderar b&#xe5;da n&#xe4;tverken. Se PLANit insats 14665.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Swedish Investors for Sustainable Development (SISD) is a network that convenes more than 20 of Sweden&#x2019;s largest financial actors around implementation of Agenda 2030. Sida coordinates the network and among its members are pension funds, insurance companies, investment companies, and asset managers. SISD works to explore the role of investors, risks and opportunities related to Agenda 2030 through learning, sharing experiences, voluntary projects and communication. 
The SISD and Swedish Leadership for Sustainable Development (SLSD) networks were combined in a new joint project from 2020, a separate appraisal will be done for 2021-2022 which covers both networks. See PLANit contribution 14665.</narrative>
  </description>
